@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### SPARE-PARTS - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /spare-parts
GET {{baseUrl}}/spare-parts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /spare-parts/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/spare-parts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /spare-parts
POST {{baseUrl}}/spare-parts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "REP-DEMO-001",
  "name": "Pantalla de repuesto",
  "description": "Pantalla de prueba para reparación de equipos",
  "compatibility": "Modelo X100",
  "cost": "80000.00",
  "price": "120000.00",
  "currentStock": 10,
  "minimumStock": 2
}

